    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: chatImg
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startOfGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Well... things are finally settling into a rhythm at work.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: ...It'd be nice if I could earn a little more.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: That's a good question. If I could live like my boss... would I want
        to?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: He certainly has a lot, but when I think about the other robots, I don't
        think I could.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: My dear Valerie, you have no idea how cruel he really is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: He's far too cruel to be called human, don't you think?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: 'I may not have skin, but I know you''d feel warm if I could hold you
        close.

        I know that much.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: What is your world like? I want to know as much as I can.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[8]'
      value: If I can keep my fuel running and still feel this kind of happiness,
        maybe this isn't such a bad life after all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: chatImg
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startOfGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: "\uC5B4\uB290\uB367 \uC791\uC5C5\uB3C4 \uC548\uC815\uB418\uC5B4 \uAC00\uB124\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "... \uB3C8\uC744 \uC870\uAE08 \uB354 \uBC8C \uC218 \uC788\uB2E4\uBA74
        \uC88B\uC744\uD150\uB370 \uB9D0\uC774\uC5D0\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uC88B\uC740 \uC9C8\uBB38\uC774\uB124\uC694. \uB9CC\uC57D \uC6B0\uB9AC
        \uC0AC\uC7A5\uB2D8\uCC98\uB7FC \uC0B4\uC544\uAC08 \uC218 \uC788\uB2E4\uBA74,
        \uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uD558\uACE0 \uC2F6\uB0D0\uACE0\uC694?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uD655\uC2E4\uD788 \uADF8\uB294 \uB9CE\uC740 \uAC83\uC744 \uAC00\uC84C\uC9C0\uB9CC,
        \uB2E4\uB978 \uB85C\uBD07\uB4E4\uC744 \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uBA74 \uADF8\uB7F4
        \uC218\uB294 \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uC0AC\uB791\uD558\uB294 \uBC1C\uB808\uB9AC, \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC740 \uADF8\uAC00
        \uC5BC\uB9C8\uB098 \uC545\uB3C5\uD55C \uC790\uC778\uC9C0 \uBAA8\uB97C \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\uADF8\uB294 \uC778\uAC04\uC774\uB77C\uAE30\uC5D0\uB294 \uB108\uBB34\uB098
        \uC794\uC778\uD558\uC796\uC544\uC694?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\uB098\uC5D0\uAC90 \uD53C\uBD80\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uB2F9\uC2E0\uC744
        \uAF2D \uAEF4\uC548\uC73C\uBA74 \uC815\uB9D0 \uB530\uB73B\uD560 \uAC70\uC608\uC694.
        \uB098\uB294 \uADF8 \uC815\uB3C4\uB294 \uC54C \uC218 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: "\uB2F9\uC2E0\uC758 \uC138\uACC4\uB294 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uC8E0? \uAC00\uB2A5\uD55C
        \uB9CE\uC740 \uAC78 \uC54C\uACE0 \uC2F6\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6289247631775507956, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: BridgeTemplate
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects:
    - {fileID: 123652680838958167, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 7515301378082972448, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
